><surname>Zhuang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaneda</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mansfield</surname><given-names>SD</given-names></name><name><surname>Samuels</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Ritland</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellis</surname><given-names>BE</given-names></name><name><surname>Bohlmann</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Douglas</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Global transcript profiling of primary stems from Arabidopsis thaliana identifies candidate genes for missing links in lignin biosynthesis and transcriptional regulators of fiber differentiation</article-title><source>Plant J</source><year>2005</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>618</fpage><lpage>640</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15918878</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-313X.2005.02403.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Aubourg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lecharny</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bohlmann</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genomic analysis of the terpenoid synthase ( AtTPS) gene family of Arabidopsis thaliana</article-title><source>Mol Genet Genomics</source><year>2002</year><volume>267</volume><fpage>730</fpage><lpage>745</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12207221</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00438-002-0709-y</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lange</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ghassemian</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genome organization in Arabidopsis thaliana: a survey for genes involved in isoprenoid and chl